 Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and May to June and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle got 168% of normal in January to February but only 64% in August to September 2025. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 55% of normal on the middle. Grid 21200 had its driest year in 1963, at 69% of normal.</p>"}
